{"seq":1,"slug":"view-protocol","title":"View 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swiftui-in-depth/fundamentals/view-protocol","wordCount":1266,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"view-协议\">View 协议</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p><code>View</code> 协议是 SwiftUI 中一切可视元素的基石。无论是内置的 <code>Text</code>、<code>Image</code>，还是开发者自定义的组件，都遵循 <code>View</code> 协议。理解 <code>View</code> 协议的工作方式，是掌握 SwiftUI 架构的第一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    VP[&quot;View 协议&quot;] --&gt; BP[&quot;body 属性&quot;]&#10;    VP --&gt; SV[&quot;some View 返回&quot;]&#10;    VP --&gt; VI[&quot;视图标识&quot;]&#10;    VP --&gt; VK[&quot;视图分类&quot;]&#10;&#10;    VK --&gt; STV[&quot;结构型视图&quot;]&#10;    VK --&gt; MOV[&quot;修饰器视图&quot;]&#10;&#10;    STV --&gt; C1[&quot;Text / Image / Button&quot;]&#10;    MOV --&gt; C2[&quot;.font / .padding / .background&quot;]&#10;&#10;    VI --&gt; SI[&quot;结构标识&quot;]&#10;    VI --&gt; EI[&quot;显式标识 .id()&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    VP[\"View 协议\"] --&gt; BP[\"body 属性\"]\n    VP --&gt; SV[\"some View 返回\"]\n    VP --&gt; VI[\"视图标识\"]\n    VP --&gt; VK[\"视图分类\"]\n\n    VK --&gt; STV[\"结构型视图\"]\n    VK --&gt; MOV[\"修饰器视图\"]\n\n    STV --&gt; C1[\"Text / Image / Button\"]\n    MOV --&gt; C2[\".font / .padding / .background\"]\n\n    VI --&gt; SI[\"结构标识\"]\n    VI --&gt; EI[\"显式标识 .id()\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>View</code> 协议把「视图是什么」和「视图如何被渲染」彻底分开：结构体只描述当前状态下的界面，真正的渲染交由框架内部引擎负责。抓住下面几个概念，就能理解 SwiftUI 视图系统的全部行为。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">概念</th>\n<th align=\"left\">定义</th>\n<th align=\"left\">关键推论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>View</code> 协议</td>\n<td align=\"left\">只要求 <code>body</code> 一个计算属性</td>\n<td align=\"left\">一切可视元素都是视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>body</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">由框架按需调用的计算属性</td>\n<td align=\"left\">必须是纯函数，可被多次调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>some View</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不透明返回类型</td>\n<td align=\"left\">编译期确定类型，零运行时开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">视图标识</td>\n<td align=\"left\">结构标识 + 显式标识（<code>.id()</code>）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">标识变则状态重置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">值类型视图</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>View</code> 是 struct</td>\n<td align=\"left\">轻量、无继承、靠组合复用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"view-协议的定义\">View 协议的定义</h2><h2 id=\"view-协议的定义\">View 协议的定义</h2><p><code>View</code> 协议的核心极其简洁，只要求一个关联类型和一个计算属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"public protocol View {&#10;    associatedtype Body: View&#10;    @ViewBuilder var body: Self.Body { get }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> View</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    associatedtype</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ViewBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.Body { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个遵循 <code>View</code> 的结构体都必须提供 <code>body</code> 属性，返回另一个 <code>View</code>。这形成了递归的视图树结构，直到遇到<strong>原始视图（primitive view）</strong>——由 SwiftUI 框架内部实现的基础视图，如 <code>Text</code>、<code>Color</code> 等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct WelcomeView: View {&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack {&#10;            Text(&quot;欢迎来到 SwiftUI&quot;)&#10;                .font(.largeTitle)&#10;            Image(systemName: &quot;swift&quot;)&#10;                .font(.system(size: 60))&#10;                .foregroundStyle(.orange)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WelcomeView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"欢迎来到 SwiftUI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.largeTitle)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">systemName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"swift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">system</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">foregroundStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.orange)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>View</code> 协议的 <code>Body</code> 关联类型是在编译期确定的，这让 SwiftUI 能够在编译期构建完整的类型信息，避免运行时的类型擦除开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"body-属性的本质\">body 属性的本质</h2><p><code>body</code> 是一个<strong>计算属性</strong>，而不是存储属性。每次 SwiftUI 需要了解视图的当前外观时，就会调用 <code>body</code>。这意味着：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">特性</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">调用时机</td>\n<td align=\"left\">状态变化时由框架调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">调用频率</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可能被多次调用，不可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">纯函数性</td>\n<td align=\"left\">相同状态应产生相同的视图描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">性能要求</td>\n<td align=\"left\">必须快速返回，禁止执行耗时操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">副作用</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不应包含网络请求、文件 IO 等副作用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct TimerView: View {&#10;    @State private var count = 0&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack(spacing: 16) {&#10;            Text(&quot;计数: \\(count)&quot;)&#10;                .font(.title)&#10;            Button(&quot;增加&quot;) {&#10;                count += 1&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TimerView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spacing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"计数: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(count)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"增加\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 <code>count</code> 发生变化时，SwiftUI 会重新调用 <code>body</code>，获取新的视图描述，再与旧描述进行 diff，最终只更新变化的部分。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"some-view-与不透明返回类型\">some View 与不透明返回类型</h2><p><code>some View</code> 是 Swift 5.1 引入的<strong>不透明返回类型（Opaque Return Type）</strong>。它告诉编译器：「返回值遵循 <code>View</code> 协议，但具体类型由实现决定」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct ProfileView: View {&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        HStack {&#10;            Image(systemName: &quot;person.circle&quot;)&#10;            Text(&quot;用户名&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        HStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">systemName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person.circle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"用户名\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器会推断 <code>body</code> 的真实类型为 <code>HStack&lt;TupleView&lt;(Image, Text)&gt;&gt;</code>，但对外只暴露 <code>some View</code>。这有两个关键优势：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;不透明返回类型的优势&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;编译期类型安全&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;零运行时开销&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;接口简洁&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;隐藏实现细节&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;AnyView 的代价&quot;&#10;        E[&quot;类型擦除&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;运行时开销&quot;]&#10;        G[&quot;丧失 Diff 优化&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;性能下降&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"不透明返回类型的优势\"\n        A[\"编译期类型安全\"] --&gt; B[\"零运行时开销\"]\n        C[\"接口简洁\"] --&gt; D[\"隐藏实现细节\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"AnyView 的代价\"\n        E[\"类型擦除\"] --&gt; F[\"运行时开销\"]\n        G[\"丧失 Diff 优化\"] --&gt; H[\"性能下降\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"视图标识-view-identity\">视图标识 (View Identity)</h2><p>SwiftUI 需要在视图树更新时识别每个视图的身份，以决定哪些视图是「同一个」视图的新状态，哪些是全新的视图。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结构标识-structural-identity\">结构标识 (Structural Identity)</h3><p>默认情况下，SwiftUI 根据视图在视图树中的<strong>位置</strong>来确定其身份：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct ContentView: View {&#10;    @State private var showDetail = false&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack {&#10;            if showDetail {&#10;                DetailView()&#10;            } else {&#10;                PlaceholderView()&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> showDetail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> showDetail {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                DetailView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                PlaceholderView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在这个例子中，<code>DetailView</code> 和 <code>PlaceholderView</code> 占据不同的分支位置，SwiftUI 将它们视为<strong>不同的视图</strong>。切换时会销毁旧视图并创建新视图。</p>\n<h3 id=\"显式标识-explicit-identity\">显式标识 (Explicit Identity)</h3><p>使用 <code>.id()</code> 修饰器可以为视图赋予显式标识：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct ListView: View {&#10;    let items: [Item]&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        ScrollView {&#10;            LazyVStack {&#10;                ForEach(items) { item in&#10;                    ItemRow(item: item)&#10;                        .id(item.id)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items: [Item]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ScrollView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            LazyVStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                ForEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items) { item </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    ItemRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 当显式标识发生变化时，SwiftUI 会销毁旧视图并创建新实例，同时<strong>重置所有关联的状态</strong>。这可以用于强制刷新视图。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构型视图与修饰器视图\">结构型视图与修饰器视图</h2><p>SwiftUI 中的视图可分为两大类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">类别</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">结构型视图</td>\n<td align=\"left\">直接产生可见内容或布局结构</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>Text</code>, <code>Image</code>, <code>VStack</code>, <code>List</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">修饰器视图</td>\n<td align=\"left\">包装并修改现有视图的外观或行为</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>.font()</code>, <code>.padding()</code>, <code>.background()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>修饰器的本质是返回一个新的视图，包裹住原视图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let view = Text(&quot;Hello&quot;)&#10;    .font(.title)&#10;    .padding()&#10;    .background(.blue)&#10;    .clipShape(RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 8))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> view </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.blue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clipShape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RoundedRectangle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cornerRadius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面的代码在编译后形成嵌套结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;ClipShape&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Background&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Padding&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Font&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Text(#quot;Hello#quot;)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"ClipShape\"] --&gt; B[\"Background\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Padding\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Font\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Text(#quot;Hello#quot;)\"]</pre><p>每一层修饰器都是一个<strong>泛型包装结构体</strong>。修饰器的顺序很重要——先 <code>padding</code> 再 <code>background</code> 与先 <code>background</code> 再 <code>padding</code> 效果完全不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct OrderMattersView: View {&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack(spacing: 20) {&#10;            Text(&quot;先 padding 再 background&quot;)&#10;                .padding()&#10;                .background(.blue)&#10;&#10;            Text(&quot;先 background 再 padding&quot;)&#10;                .background(.blue)&#10;                .padding()&#10;        }&#10;        .foregroundStyle(.white)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderMattersView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spacing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"先 padding 再 background\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.blue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"先 background 再 padding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.blue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">foregroundStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.white)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"视图是值类型\">视图是值类型</h2><p>SwiftUI 的 <code>View</code> 是<strong>结构体（struct）</strong>，而不是类。这意味着视图是值类型，具有以下特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">特性</th>\n<th align=\"left\">影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">值语义</td>\n<td align=\"left\">视图的复制是廉价的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">无继承</td>\n<td align=\"left\">通过组合而非继承来复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">轻量级</td>\n<td align=\"left\">视图只是状态的描述，不持有 UI 资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">短生命周期</td>\n<td align=\"left\">每次 <code>body</code> 调用时可能创建新实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct CardView: View {&#10;    let title: String&#10;    let subtitle: String&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: 4) {&#10;            Text(title)&#10;                .font(.headline)&#10;            Text(subtitle)&#10;                .font(.subheadline)&#10;                .foregroundStyle(.secondary)&#10;        }&#10;        .padding()&#10;        .background(.regularMaterial)&#10;        .clipShape(RoundedRectangle(cornerRadius: 12))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CardView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> title: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subtitle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alignment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .leading, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">spacing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.headline)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(subtitle)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">font</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.subheadline)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">foregroundStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.secondary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.regularMaterial)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clipShape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RoundedRectangle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cornerRadius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>视图结构体本身非常轻量，真正的渲染工作由 SwiftUI 的内部引擎负责。开发者创建的 <code>View</code> 结构体本质上只是一份<strong>渲染描述</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>View</code> 协议是 SwiftUI 的核心抽象，只要求实现 <code>body</code> 计算属性</li>\n<li><code>body</code> 返回 <code>some View</code>（不透明返回类型），编译期确定具体类型，零运行时开销</li>\n<li>视图标识分为<strong>结构标识</strong>（基于位置）和<strong>显式标识</strong>（<code>.id()</code> 修饰器）</li>\n<li>视图分为<strong>结构型视图</strong>（产生内容）和<strong>修饰器视图</strong>（包装修改）两类</li>\n<li>修饰器的<strong>顺序影响最终效果</strong>，因为每层修饰器都是一个新的包装视图</li>\n<li><code>View</code> 是<strong>值类型（struct）</strong>，轻量且无继承，通过组合实现复用</li>\n<li><code>body</code> 应当是纯函数，不包含副作用，可被框架任意次数调用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"View 协议","id":"view-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"View 协议的定义","id":"view-协议的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"View 协议的定义","id":"view-协议的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"body 属性的本质","id":"body-属性的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"some View 与不透明返回类型","id":"some-view-与不透明返回类型"},{"level":2,"text":"视图标识 (View Identity)","id":"视图标识-view-identity"},{"level":3,"text":"结构标识 (Structural Identity)","id":"结构标识-structural-identity"},{"level":3,"text":"显式标识 (Explicit Identity)","id":"显式标识-explicit-identity"},{"level":2,"text":"结构型视图与修饰器视图","id":"结构型视图与修饰器视图"},{"level":2,"text":"视图是值类型","id":"视图是值类型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"body 与 some View","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swiftui-in-depth/fundamentals/body-and-some-view"}}